# Recorded input for the icon example page (widgets/icon.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 200 in the
# default theme: the 16 px icon at 8..24 x 9..25 before "Documents", the Save button at
# 8..48 x 34..74 holding the 24 px icon at 16..40 x 42..66 (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: press the standalone icon: nothing takes it
frame
pointer 16 17
buttons left
# 2: release: nothing
frame
buttons
# 3: hover the icon in the button: the button lights
frame
pointer 28 54
# 4: press it
frame
buttons left
# 5: release over it: the button is clicked
frame
buttons
